  "scope": "This batch only: GGUF NVFP4 descriptors/native operators and MMQ repeated-slot repair. Not completion of the broad architecture goal.",
  "changes": [
    "Distinct GGUF NVFP4 identity: appended ordinal21,64 logical values/36bytes with four inline UE4M3 subgroup scales; existing identities unchanged.",
    "CPU/CUDA/Vulkan retain original packed weights for MatMul/GroupedMatMul; Gather decodes only selected rows.",
    "CUDA original NVFP4 conversion math shared with64-block GetRows; old256-block paths unchanged.",
    "MMQ metadata now preserves every token-slot occurrence, including repeated expert IDs; forward/inverse maps retain token-major slot-major order.",
    "Removed obsolete per-token shared store and its22/10-bit packing restrictions; actual flattened I32 bound and public capacity/stride checks remain.",
    "Four offline IREE compiler entry scripts disable bytecode before local imports, preventing untracked vendor cache pollution."
  ],
